  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Central Continent Gu Immortals cut a path through the saint regional wall toward Northern Plains, Fairy Ao Xue and Fairy Ling Mei take the lead. Two rank six Immortal Gu support the cast. Immortal essence cost and mental burden are extremely high.",
      "chapters": [
        710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "char_fairy_ao_xue",
        "char_fairy_ling_mei",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Activation forms a solid blue crescent moon about the size of a water jar. After they store enough power, the crescent flies silently and cuts about seventy-six steps into the saint regional wall. Chen Zhen Chi calls it a well-known killer move of Heaven’s Envy Manor for that cut. Deeper in the wall, slowing thoughts make immortal killer moves hard to activate, and the two fairies can no longer use peerless crescent moon slash; a thousand steps later they walk while supporting each other.",
      "chapters": [
        710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wall-cut",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chen_zhen_chi",
        "fac_heavens_envy_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the hundred days battle their combined cast injured almost all Shadow Sect Gu Immortals to varying degrees.",
      "chapters": [
        923
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hundred-days-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk among remaining Central Continent Gu Immortals notes that if Ao Xue and Ling Mei die, Heaven’s Envy Manor loses that signature killer move, a serious loss even for a manor with deep foundations.",
      "chapters": [
        927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
